: 759, "end": 855, "text": "After completing her Ph.D., Hung went on to pursue a successful career in academia and research."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 856, "end": 1013, "text": "She has held positions at prestigious institutions, including the University of Michigan and the National Institute of Environmental Health Sciences (NIEHS)."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1014, "end": 1135, "text": "Her research focuses on statistical methodology and its applications to environmental health, genetics, and epidemiology."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1136, "end": 1139, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1141, "end": 1155, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1157, "end": 1196, "text": "[1] University of California, Berkeley."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1197, "end": 1204, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1205, "end": 1236, "text": "Department of Statistics: Ph.D."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1237, "end": 1244, "text": "Alumni."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1245, "end": 1315, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/statistics.berkeley.edu\\/alumni\\/phd-alumni>"}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1317, "end": 1329, "text": "[2] Hung, Y."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1330, "end": 1337, "text": "(1993)."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1338, "end": 1425, "text": "Asymptotic Theory of Estimation in Nonlinear Regression Models (Doctoral dissertation)."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1426, "end": 1461, "text": "University of California, Berkeley."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1462, "end": 1518, "text": "[3] National Institute of Environment